    "Banteay Srei medium-fi surviving exterior: three stepped pink-sandstone sanctuary towers and lotus finials, recessed/false doors with curved pediments, eastern mandapa, two corbel-roofed libraries, inner gateways, lower outer/approach gateway remains and concentric stone/laterite enclosure traces. Native map moat and paths remain independent. Fine narrative sculpture, individual carved figures and exact damage inventories are not reproduced.",
